    "description": {
      "value": "You've managed to eke out an existence in the storm-wracked Sodden Lands and have become an expert at scavenging food and tools.\n\nChoose two ability boosts. One must be to Constitution or Wisdom, and one is a free ability boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Survival skill and the Swamp Lore skill.\n\nYou gain the Forager skill feat."
